---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+16105550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(610) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="No Cool Air Newtown Square PA | AC Repair" description="No Cool Air? Fast diagnosis and repair in Newtown Square, PA. Same-day AC service. Call (610) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → <a href="/#problems">Problems</a> → No Cool Air</div>
      <h1>No Cool Air</h1>
      <p>Don't wait — early diagnosis prevents bigger failures and higher bills in Newtown Square homes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-block" style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">
        <h2>What Causes No Cool Air?</h2>
        <p>Several issues can lead to this symptom. Our technicians test the system systematically — electrical components, refrigerant charge, airflow, and controls — so we fix the real problem, not just a symptom.</p>
        <p>In many cases we complete the repair on the first visit. You always receive a clear explanation and written estimate before work begins.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Same-day service available</li>
          <li>All major brands and system types</li>
          <li>Honest repair vs. replace advice</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Service — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
